AB  - dhscmort estimates neonatal, post-neonatal, infant, child and under-five mortality from Demographic and Health Surveys (DHS) Birth Recode datasets using the DHS synthetic cohort approach. It produces weighted mortality estimates, supports disaggregation by background characteristics, generates bar charts and creates binary mortality variables for further analysis.
